#   - "4 Boom kept: trap(division by zero)"
#   - "S { n = 2 }"
#   - "1 kept: replay with adapters disconnected gives the live state_hash"
# provenance: targeted: HC-21, a kept step is appended with the state unchanged and host.StepKept {cause trap}; the kept input stays in D and replay re-derives the live state
